#: 8966ad7f26784024a1349310db8a4e1f 9f4e3a67b1c34a1fb940a6edcb465a4b
msgid ""
"In order to continue providing, maintaining and improving the rich ArduPilot"
" ecosystem, the Project relies heavily on generous donations of time from "
"many people - but we also incur financial costs that must be covered.  "
"Simplistically, meeting these costs is what the Partners Program achieves."
msgstr ""
"为了继续提供、维护和改进丰富的 ArduPilot "
"生态系统，项目在很大程度上依赖于许多人慷慨捐献的时间——但我们也会产生必须覆盖的财务成本。简单来说，合作伙伴计划的目标就是满足这些成本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:30
#: 008bb6d7bf3e4608b6accb4aaeaeea82 05d7083e3c9d4d98b792582693313062
#: 06274a33e4d54cee961be59dd102a975 2f8c8aa237d645ecb1143e25a68a497e
#: 4781e791d1834a30adace9e8b702af80 4d50c6b850e440839cefa61f90af9377
#: 5027cb0091a64a70ac4ef5977eef1b09 7c753a995aad42ad9288856e1e2c8674
#: 811bfa4be8434eb484a230807b5b466f b449e2cca4f24673967182f69dcdcfd6
#: c40c9ad33ee14667801072b0fd3f4c03 e4f4a322ad2e42b48b1f7a2d3e6894e7
msgid ""
"The partnerships we have with companies also help to guide the development "
"of ArduPilot. We look to the partners to help us choose what features to "
"prioritise, what documentation we need to work on and how we can best use "
"the funds we have available to continue to make ArduPilot the best autopilot"
" available."
msgstr ""
"我们与公司建立的合作伙伴关系也有助于指导 ArduPilot "
"的开发。我们希望合作伙伴帮助我们确定优先开发哪些功能、需要完善哪些文档，以及如何最好地利用可用资金继续使 ArduPilot 成为最佳飞控。"

