#: cf9f97b496f943de8c335c37c7bb4d65 f339e7042daa42cba0d4b4014061e4f3
msgid ""
"One of the biggest benefits to a company of joining the partners program is "
"the deep level of technical support that we can provide. For each partner we"
" create a private discussion channel where the partner can ask questions, "
"post logs for review or discuss features. We also have a shared channel that"
" all partners can access to facilitate discussions between partners."
msgstr ""
"公司加入合作伙伴计划的最大好处之一是我们可以提供深层次的技术支持。对于每个合作伙伴，我们会创建一个私密讨论频道，合作伙伴可以在那里提问、发布日志供审查或讨论功能。我们还有一个所有合作伙伴都可以访问的共享频道，以促进合作伙伴之间的讨论。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-partners-program.rst:46
#: 01519d0fe86f43d79f314918e4197960 2bdbec939bc4413182e99e2ff021540f
#: 3c8a405e81774e118523e7bebd54bb9c 412b729edb234e7a8a6783228ead7ab1
#: 4e3bd8fea7c8485c928af69503136927 667ced50028a492d83cfb58e00647517
#: 6cad334f806d4ae988b3a3f12b563e79 83c3753497664aa2998566c403e6cb7c
#: 87724789d2754527b4db0e32db35183e 9902221fcd4548c7901ed96cae16c3e0
#: b7e3fa8bde4d458cb45a55c094df0b3b faa5c97fb9fc442c9b01dde4d4d998cd
msgid ""
"The partners program funds highly qualified support engineers to help "
"support the needs of partners. These support engineers are not full time, "
"but we do strive to provide very timely support for partners and we're proud"
" of our track record of providing top quality support and technical advice."
msgstr ""
"合作伙伴计划资助高度专业的支持工程师来帮助满足合作伙伴的支持需求。这些支持工程师不是全职的，但我们确实力求为合作伙伴提供非常及时的支持，并为我们提供顶级支持和技术建议的良好记录感到自豪。"

