msgid ""
"No.  ArduPilot is, and always will be, open source.  Contributions to the "
"code base, wherever they come from, are accepted based on their technical "
"merits.  If you're not in a position to make the changes yourself, please "
"add it to the `Issues list "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ or consider contracting "
"one of the companies listed on the :ref:`Commercial Support page <common-"
"commercial-support>` to make the change."
msgstr ""
"不需要。ArduPilot 是，也将永远是开源的。对代码库的贡献，无论来自哪里，都根据其技术优点被接受。如果您自己无法进行更改，请将其添加到 `问题列表"
" <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__，或考虑委托 :ref:`商业支持页面 "
"<common-commercial-support>` 上列出的公司之一进行更改。"
